Since apparently I'm in some
trouble, I'll have to defend myself.

93
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:16,040
Okay, let's do this.

94
00:09:16,220 --> 00:09:17,980
You must maintain your role.

95
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:21,740
Listen closely.

96
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:23,797
You are in the land of Wano.

97
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:25,220
We have a Shogun.

98
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:28,960
Remember his name, Kurozumi Orochi.

99
00:09:29,980 --> 00:09:32,897
Do keep in mind that
any officials who do his

100
