bidding all have ties to
the Emperor Kaido himself.

101
00:09:36,620 --> 00:09:39,720
Thus, these men are robes,
arrogant, and corrupt.

102
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:44,797
That's why, if you harm them, Kaido
will be the first to hear of it.

103
