We must not allow our
existence to be known

104
00:09:48,340 --> 00:09:51,680
until our allies can
assemble with us once more.

105
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:54,360
Only then can preparations begin.

106
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:58,417
It is essential that you blend
in seamlessly with the locals.

107
00:09:58,500 --> 00:10:01,265
You'll live quietly and
go about your business.

108
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:02,980
It is your duty.

109
