Guess I got no choice.

112
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:13,040
On my honor, I surrender.

113
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:15,380
Go! Grab him!

114
00:10:25,060 --> 00:10:29,180
The menacing scourge who is
terrorizing our town is now in custody.

115
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:33,160
Our brave magistrate has finally
apprehended that scoundrel.

116
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:36,165
As punishment, he's being
sentenced to seppuku.

117
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:39,637
You can read about the rest
of the details right in here.

118
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,550
Good credit!

119
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:43,857
He's the man that
murdered my poor husband!

120
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:45,220
What a relief!

121
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:50,461
I was worried this place would never be
safe again after the three recent slashings.

122
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:56,600
Excuse me, do you mind
if I get one of those?

123
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,777
Sure, here you go!

124
00:10:58,860 --> 00:11:00,900
Z-Zoro-Juro?

125
00:11:10,700 --> 00:11:13,640
So your name is Zoro Judo, is it?

126
00:11:14,820 --> 00:11:19,120
Your carnage has stricken fear
into the hearts of our populace.

127
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:24,740
If you do the honorable thing and commit
seppuku, our town shall be peaceful again.

128
00:11:26,180 --> 00:11:27,780
Well, look at that.

129
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:29,120
How funny.

130
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:32,631
Apparently, you're a grave robber as well.

131
00:11:34,300 --> 00:11:38,280
Twenty-three years ago,
amidst a pirate upheaval,

132
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:42,900
the whereabouts of a legendary blade
and the corpse of its owner, Ryuma,

133
00:11:43,260 --> 00:11:44,090
went missing.

134
00:11:44,340 --> 00:11:47,460
The name of his famed blade was Shusui.

135
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:52,460
Legend has it that Ryuma chopped the
head off a giant dragon with this sword,

136
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:55,880
and now I hold it in my hands.

137
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:57,730
Incredible.

138
00:11:58,380 --> 00:11:59,210
People?

139
00:11:59,293 --> 00:12:00,260
Just how old are you?

140
00:12:00,580 --> 00:12:01,560
I'm curious.

141
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:06,360
That infamous grave robbery
took place over two decades ago.

142
00:12:06,780 --> 00:12:09,120
You seem a bit young to have done that.

143
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:11,740
Did you steal it from the thief?

144
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:16,599
It doesn't matter.

145
00:12:16,700 --> 00:12:18,660
I possess the sword now.

146
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:21,080
And what a fine treasure it is.

147
00:12:27,100 --> 00:12:27,930
Sir!

148
00:12:28,013 --> 00:12:30,700
The time is upon us,
Zorojuro. Are you ready?

149
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,897
What gives?

150
00:12:36,980 --> 00:12:38,500
This blade's got no hilt.

151
00:12:42,660 --> 00:12:43,860
Your mightiness.

152
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:47,657
There's no need for one, as it's
not a weapon forged for battle.

153
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:50,140
The knife's short and lacks a handle.

154
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,440
It's on purpose.

155
00:12:51,780 --> 00:12:52,780
You imbecile!

156
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:56,691
Are you making jest of the
situation in your final moments?

157
00:12:56,780 --> 00:12:58,980
If you have any pride as a samurai,

158
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:02,182
