amends with your death.

159
00:13:02,580 --> 00:13:05,404
I'll make sure you don't
suffer in your passing.

160
00:13:06,380 --> 00:13:07,840
It is my duty.

161
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,880
In that case, farewell.

162
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:36,100
Don't cry like a baby.

163
00:13:37,060 --> 00:13:41,600
When a samurai meets his end, he
needs to do the honorable thing.

164
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:46,377
Your guilt is certain, and
your crimes were unspeakable.

165
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:50,120
You are receiving an honorable
death that you hardly deserve.

166
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:53,140
Take pride in your sepulchre.

167
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:12,920
I can still smell the scent of blood.

168
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:14,350
Gah!

169
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:17,780
It's from you.

170
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:21,380
You're the slasher.

171
