I had to.

172
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,700
Sorry, Kin'emon.

173
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,980
So we made it then, Wano.

174
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:55,977
where is everybody let me think

175
00:15:56,060 --> 00:16:00,320
what happened to us again let's see

176
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:11,920
go strike him down Oh, no!

177
00:16:39,920 --> 00:16:40,750
No!

178
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:42,230
No!

179
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,750
Ah!

180
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:00,750
Shh!

181
