190
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:18,400
I guess this really is the land of Wano.

191
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:28,380
Wild sword monkey versus wild dog thing?

192
00:18:28,660 --> 00:18:30,580
Wano's a pretty crazy place.

193
00:18:58,380 --> 00:18:59,560
Hey, you two.

194
00:18:59,940 --> 00:19:02,117
You can fight each other all you want.

195
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,965
Just don't do it near my ship.

196
