200
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:33,459
I think that the tide is
running in reverse somehow.

201
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,200
Just hang in there, Sunny!

202
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:40,800
Don't worry, Nami, I got you.

203
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:42,680
I appreciate it, Sanji.

204
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:46,580
Oh, it's my pleasure, I assure you! Sanji!

205
00:19:46,940 --> 00:19:47,780
Grab on to me.

206
