I'm just kidding.

217
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:16,597
I've always got your back, Chopper.

218
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:17,510
Got you!

219
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:22,000
I hope you all saved room for one more!

220
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,120
Let's bring it in! Love you!

221
00:20:27,340 --> 00:20:29,940
No offense, but you're kind of pokey.

222
00:20:30,140 --> 00:20:31,375
You're way too close!

223
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:32,837
Prop, stop being gross!

224
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:35,420
Use my belly to bounce sound good

225
00:20:37,540 --> 00:20:38,780
It's a plan

226
00:20:50,420 --> 00:20:54,960
All right, you be good sunny,
okay promise to come fight

227
00:21:06,940 --> 00:21:08,320
The octopus!

228
00:21:09,420 --> 00:21:12,100
What do you even want from me, huh?

229
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:14,920
The octopus!

230
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:17,810
The octopus!

231
00:21:31,060 --> 00:21:34,040
Yeah, that must be why
I woke up on this beach.

232
00:21:34,900 --> 00:21:36,840
Am I still above the waterfall?

233
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:38,520
Or is this below it?

234
00:21:38,700 --> 00:21:40,818
I can't tell if this is mono or not.

235
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:48,510
Crap!

236
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:49,860
The Vibra card!

237
00:21:51,460 --> 00:21:52,960
Where did it go?

238
00:21:53,280 --> 00:21:54,720
Is it in the sea?

239
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,800
Damn it!

240
00:22:00,920 --> 00:22:01,880
Oh well.

241
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,310
Whatever.

242
00:22:04,220 --> 00:22:05,050
Stop!

243
00:22:06,280 --> 00:22:08,160
Let me go already!

244
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:10,340
I didn't say nothing like that!

245
00:22:10,580 --> 00:22:12,300
Give me back my rice too!

246
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:14,840
I know what I heard.

247
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:20,720
The Kozuki clan is gonna come
back, and then you'll pay!

248
00:22:21,820 --> 00:22:22,700
You traitor.

249
00:22:24,060 --> 00:22:27,942
You've chosen to ally yourself
with a bunch of villains, have you?

250
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:30,997
That's a serious crime,
and there'll be no mercy,

251
00:22:31,080 --> 00:22:34,537
