to a brothel or toss you in jail!

252
00:22:34,620 --> 00:22:35,450
But mister!

253
00:22:35,740 --> 00:22:37,000
Aw, shut your trap!

254
00:22:37,600 --> 00:22:39,780
Enough, we've got a job to do.

255
00:22:42,380 --> 00:22:44,117
Look, there's a ship on the beach!

256
00:22:44,200 --> 00:22:45,820
Just one survivor.

257
00:22:46,120 --> 00:22:48,620
The baboon's still battling the lion dog?

258
00:22:48,900 --> 00:22:53,135
I thought he was at least strong
enough to take care of that puny thing.

259
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:55,040
Oh, it's you.

260
00:22:56,720 --> 00:22:58,220
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

261
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:02,100
Okay, guys, knock it off
already. There it is.

262
00:23:02,220 --> 00:23:03,573
We found the ship, sir.

263
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:05,837
Looks like the report was correct.

264
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:07,155
Can you see its crew?

265
00:23:07,360 --> 00:23:08,440
Just one man.

266
00:23:08,900 --> 00:23:09,860
How interesting.

267
00:23:10,420 --> 00:23:12,297
We'll knock him out and
bring him back with us.

268
00:23:12,380 --> 00:23:15,480
