good laborers, sir.

269
00:23:20,940 --> 00:23:23,360
That's a good boy to stay right there.

270
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:26,824
When you wake up, we'll
have a surprise for you.

271
00:23:27,060 --> 00:23:28,580
A lifetime of slavery.

272
00:23:44,180 --> 00:23:45,010
Oh

273
00:23:50,660 --> 00:23:53,900
Who just attacked me you bastard

274
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:03,820
Hey, what's going on?

275
00:24:06,500 --> 00:24:07,330
Nothing, sir

276
00:24:13,100 --> 00:24:13,930
Aaaaaaahhh!

277
00:24:22,380 --> 00:24:23,968
This beach is popular, huh?

278
00:24:25,300 --> 00:24:26,130
Damn!

279
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:28,840
You stupid baboon!

280
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:30,177
Don't just stand there!

281
00:24:30,260 --> 00:24:31,613
You gotta do something!

282
00:24:32,180 --> 00:24:33,860
Forget the mud for now!

283
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:35,180
Catch that guy!

284
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:41,940
Actually, you know what?

285
00:24:42,380 --> 00:24:43,760
Go ahead and kill him!

286
00:25:14,740 --> 00:25:16,920
You want something?

287
00:25:47,080 --> 00:25:48,197
Ha! Good.

288
00:25:48,280 --> 00:25:51,100
Now you two play nice and get along, okay?

289
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:56,857
Why the hell are you
bowing your hand like that?

290
00:25:56,940 --> 00:25:59,480
It's just one measly pirate, you fool!

291
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:14,980
You miserable brat!

292
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,860
I'll make you pay!

293
00:26:17,860 --> 00:26:20,120
You are gonna die for that one!

294
00:26:21,040 --> 00:26:23,580
There's no use running from me!

295
00:26:23,780 --> 00:26:25,640
I'm really sorry, but...

296
00:26:32,520 --> 00:26:34,020
I surrender!

297
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:36,100
I surrender!

298
00:26:36,940 --> 00:26:39,560
What are you doing, weirdo?

299
00:26:39,900 --> 00:26:41,357
I said I surrender!

300
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:43,440
This is the surrender pose.

301
00:26:48,840 --> 00:26:51,980
I wasn't going to do anything
to you, though. Really?

302
00:26:52,360 --> 00:26:53,860
Do you mean it, sir?

303
00:26:54,560 --> 00:26:55,580
Yeah, of course.

304
00:26:56,340 --> 00:26:58,060
Okay, then maybe.

305
00:26:58,400 --> 00:27:01,297
If you're not going to kill
me, could I ask for a favor?

306
00:27:01,380 --> 00:27:02,640
An itty bitty one?

307
00:27:02,900 --> 00:27:04,420
It's my only chance.

308
00:27:06,020 --> 00:27:07,940
What is it? Tell me.

309
00:27:08,620 --> 00:27:11,900
All right, let's do it. Huh? Do what?

310
00:27:12,260 --> 00:27:14,700
Teeny-Dun, go!

311
00:27:17,900 --> 00:27:19,740
Okay, here you go.

312
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,230
Ah!

313
00:27:21,313 --> 00:27:22,980
You pulled your cheek off!

314
00:27:27,120 --> 00:27:29,220
Take it, this is for you.

315
00:27:38,660 --> 00:27:40,920
What are you even trying to do?

316
00:27:55,180 --> 00:27:56,420
Now shake.

317
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:04,700
You just tamed that huge egg monster!

318
00:28:05,140 --> 00:28:06,940
I did it! I did it!

319
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:09,820
I finally made pals
with a mountain baboon!

320
00:28:10,100 --> 00:28:12,520
Now he'll stop causing trouble for me!

321
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:14,720
Yay! Yay!

322
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:18,078
You're some kind of power user, huh?

323
00:28:18,280 --> 00:28:21,045
And it looks like it's
a pretty handy one, too.

324
00:28:25,860 --> 00:28:26,690
Attaboy!

325
00:28:26,773 --> 00:28:28,160
You're our buddy now!

326
00:28:29,220 --> 00:28:30,050
.

327
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:33,160
Good monkey!

328
00:28:33,740 --> 00:28:34,920
Is that your dog?

329
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:38,060
Yep, his name is Komachiyo!

330
00:28:40,700 --> 00:28:41,900
Hey, Komachiyo!

331
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:46,560
I'm Luffy, now let's be
friends from here on out! .

332
00:28:49,300 --> 00:28:52,160
Oh, by the way, my name's Tama!

333
00:28:53,080 --> 00:28:56,180
Alrighty then, Tama, it's
real nice to meet you!

334
00:28:56,420 --> 00:28:58,600
It's nice to meet you too! Oh, yeah.

335
00:28:58,840 --> 00:29:00,260
I got a quick question.

336
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:03,009
I need to know if I
made it to Wano or not.

337
00:29:03,480 --> 00:29:04,760
Made it to Wano?

338
00:29:06,580 --> 00:29:07,410
Well, yeah.

339
00:29:07,600 --> 00:29:09,280
This is the land of Wano.

340
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:13,920
And the beach that we're on
now is in a region called Kui.

341
00:29:14,180 --> 00:29:15,121
Got it, Big Bro?

342
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,660
Yeah, it's great.

343
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:17,860
I wasn't sure.

344
00:29:19,280 --> 00:29:22,060
I finally made it to the land of Wano.

345
00:29:23,060 --> 00:29:24,940
I'm coming for you, Kaido.

346
00:29:25,820 --> 00:29:26,650
Wait, Big Bro?

347
00:29:26,733 --> 00:29:28,080
The heck?

348
00:29:28,260 --> 00:29:30,620
When did I become your big brother, huh?

349
00:29:31,720 --> 00:29:33,760
A big brother's a big brother!

350
00:29:34,140 --> 00:29:35,560
What's that even mean?

351
00:29:36,060 --> 00:29:37,580
Oh, whatever, I guess.

352
00:29:37,740 --> 00:29:39,800
It just makes sense, big bro!

353
00:29:53,980 --> 00:29:57,320
Zoro Judo, you've
committed a serious crime.

354
00:30:07,860 --> 00:30:09,537
You'll pay, slashers.

355
00:30:09,620 --> 00:30:11,796
You still refuse to admit your guilt?

356
00:30:16,020 --> 00:30:16,850
Hmm.

357
00:30:31,500 --> 00:30:33,320
He wields three swords?

358
00:30:33,580 --> 00:30:34,480
What the hell?

359
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,880
What's he doing?

360
00:30:44,260 --> 00:30:46,120
Tatsu Maki!

361
00:31:23,080 --> 00:31:25,920
If nothing else, Juano
has some nice weather.

362
00:31:27,500 --> 00:31:29,240
The men at Cury Beach.

363
00:31:29,420 --> 00:31:31,302
We lost communication with them.

364
00:31:31,560 --> 00:31:34,540
I speculate that someone
may have taken them down.

365
00:31:34,860 --> 00:31:36,742
Why, there's no trace of a ship.

366
00:31:37,700 --> 00:31:38,876
Your thoughts, boss?

367
00:31:39,140 --> 00:31:40,199
What should we do?

368
00:31:49,320 --> 00:31:51,460
Don't let word get back to Kaido.

369
00:31:55,320 --> 00:31:56,700
I'll take care of it.
